    "updated_at": "2025-05-28T06:51:36Z",
    "body": "Would utilization of tensor network packages like quimb be okay? That way, I can quickly make this for you and rest assured that it would be optimal given quimb's optimal path contraction schema. Only downside is having to use quimb instead of numpy, though I personally don't think it's a downside.",
